# Local working copies / outputs (do not commit personal run artifacts)
PAD-Labs/
**/output/
**/logs/
**/working/
*.xlsm
~$*
DesktopFlows/

# Course slides / outline (local only — not published for learners)
slides/**
!slides/README.md
# Safety net if binaries are placed outside slides/
*.pptx
*.pdf

# Ops / classroom staff notes (local only — not published for learners)
ops/**
!ops/README.md

# Authoring guides (course writers only — not published for learners)
authoring/**
!authoring/README.md

# Cursor project skills/rules (maintainers only — not published for learners)
# Negate directory first so README can be tracked (global gitignore often ignores .cursor/)
.cursor/**
!.cursor/
!.cursor/README.md
